<title>NETHERLANDS: AXXICON 1997 FIRST QTR NET SHARPLY LOWER.</title>
<headline>AXXICON 1997 FIRST QTR NET SHARPLY LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>HELMOND, Netherlands 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr to March</p>
<p>31, 1997 (in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.5  vs   1.6</p>
<p>    Turnover				21.1  vs  22.4</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.2  vs   2.6</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.4  vs   0.2</p>
<p>    Tax					0.3  vs   0.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial moulds maker Axxicon Group NV previously</p>
<p>said it expected turnover and net profits to rise slightly in</p>
<p>1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
